mittance advice\",\n      \"dataType\": \"String\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"attributeName\": \"customerReference\",\n      \"description\": \"Customer reference captured on the remittance advice\",\n      \"dataType\": \"String\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"attributeName\": \"customerDetails\",\n      \"description\": \"Additional customer details captured on the remittance advice\",\n      \"dataType\": \"String\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"attributeName\": \"statusCode\",\n      \"description\": \"Status code of the remittance advice. Records with PURGED, DUPLICATE, or ERROR status are excluded by the extract query.\",\n      \"dataType\": \"String\",\n      \"allowedValues\": [\n        {\n          \"code\": \"NEW\",\n          \"meaning\": \"New\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"code\": \"IN_PROCESS\",\n          \"meaning\": \"In process\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"attributeName\": \"timeCreated\",\n      \"description\": \"Creation timestamp of the remittance advice record\",\n      \"dataType\": \"DateTime\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n    ]\n}"
